[REQUIREMENT]
UID: PLAN-V2-002
STATUS: InProgress
TITLE: M1a - Canonical IR, Unified Device Descriptor and thin XyceBackend
STATEMENT: >>>
Implement the immutable Canonical IR, fail-closed Unified Device Descriptor registry, typed ResultManifest schema, and thin external-process XyceBackend (GPL-isolated) in Spice.Ir and Spice.Sdk, plus opt-in independent DC/AC/transient physical audits.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Phase: M1
Depends-on: PLAN-V2-001
Deliverables: Spice.Ir (CanonicalIr incl. SParameters, DeviceRegistry incl. spice.mosfet/bjt/jfet, SpiceNetlistEmitter), Spice.Sdk (ISimulationBackend, GPL-isolated XyceBackend with CSV parser, DifferentialComparer, NativeCppBackend ABI v2.1), Spice.Tests/M1PlatformTests.cs.
Verification: .NET 11.0.100 Release build (TreatWarningsAsErrors=true) passes 6/6 xUnit tests in Spice.Tests with 0 warnings, including mocked XyceBackend deck/CSV/differential verification and live in-process NativeCppBackend ABI v2.1 OP/DC/AC/TRAN(BDF2)/NOISE/HB/PSS/SP + BSIM4 deck + parallel campaign tests over libspice_capi.so. Remaining: live external Xyce executable differential run on Windows host.
<<<
